---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { withBase } from '../utils/paths';
---
<section class="hero shell">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow"><Icon name="leaf" size={17} /> 技术笔记 · 项目记录 · 随手记</p>
    <h1>边学边做，<br />顺手记下来</h1>
    <p class="hero-intro">
      最近主要在折腾 Agent、RAG、向量数据库和 Java。
      看懂一个概念、解决一个坑、改掉一个方案，就在这里记一笔。
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href={withBase('/articles/')}><Icon name="leaf" size={18} />看文章</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href={withBase('/projects/')}><span class="folder-icon">□</span>看项目</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-meta"><span class="sprout">⌁</span> 最近在写 · Vector DB / Agent / RAG</p>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-art" aria-label="知识花园手帐插画">
    <img src={withBase('/assets/hero-garden.svg')} alt="笔记本、RAG 流程、代码卡片与绿植组成的知识花园插画" />
  </div>
</section>
